# SHAC with changed guards on NablaEngine, 3 h of training as reported: an update whose actor gradient norm is
# non-finite is skipped instead of stopping training, a large finite norm is applied, and the gradient is also clipped
# element-wise at 0.1 (as for NablaMimic). Otherwise as shac.args.
@base/shac.args
--physics engine
--hours 3
